direction: right
title: GitOps Declarative Delivery via ArgoCD

Dev: Developer (git push)
Git: Git Repository (Declarative Manifests)

K8s: Target Kubernetes Cluster {
  argo: ArgoCD Controller
  live: Live Cluster Workloads (Pods & Services)
  argo -> live: Auto-sync & drift reconciliation
}

Dev -> Git: Pull Request { style.stroke: "#38BDF8" }
Git -> K8s.argo: Webhook trigger { style.stroke: "#38BDF8" }
